Server init.
>> a := Blob novi: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista novi ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob novi: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista novi ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a novi.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Izlaz piši: ['xorred:'], novi-red. 
Izlaz piši: n, novi-red. 
} uhvati: { :e Izlaz piši: e, novi-red. }, pokreni.
a oslobodi.
b oslobodi.
